  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/J4t1Htsb/title-remodeledfence.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"318\"></p><p>將所有圍欄和圍欄門改造成更符合其樹種特色的獨特樣式。🌳</p><p>同時更新了物品欄圖示以匹配新模型。若您好奇，截圖中使用的是 Complementary Reimagined 材質包。<br>本資源包修改了以下圍欄與門的模型：</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><u>蒼白橡木</u></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><u>竹子</u></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><u>櫻花木</u></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">紅樹木</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">相思木</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">樺木</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">緋紅木</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">黑橡木</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">叢林木</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">橡木</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">杉木</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">扭曲木</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">地獄磚（圍欄）</span></li>\n</ul><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>預覽圖：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/ZnCZRcH1/2025-05-22-00-57-51.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Z5rmC0PK/2025-05-22-01-00-08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Bv40DsN5/2025-05-22-01-03-00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>如有任何意見或問題，最佳聯絡方式是透過 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Gf7uPVPHZh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Remodeled Discord 伺服器</a>。</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Gf7uPVPHZh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/JhtpyZrS/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"265\" height=\"58\"></a></p>",
